  photo: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 83ac1cbe7d2a99b449f4d7e8d0c6387f, type: 3}
  title: "Blue Moon Versand Berlin \u2013 Rated X Catalogue, 1981"
  description: "A mail-order catalogue cover from Blue Moon Versand, Berlin 1981
    \u2014 a underground distribution network serving teen-age gangsters, cool-cats,
    rockers, punks, skins, and rebels across West Germany."
  hasExtraInfo: 1
  extraInfoTitle: Underground Distribution in West Berlin
  extraInfoContent: "Blue Moon Versand was a mail-order distribution service operating
    out of\nWest Berlin in the early 1980s, selling records, tapes, and memorabilia
    to subculture\ncommunities across Germany who had no local access to such material.
    Operating\nalongside shops like Zensor, these informal networks were crucial
    in spreading\npunk, rockabilly, and new wave culture beyond the city. The 'Rated
    X' catalogue,\ncopyright 1981, was aimed explicitly at outsiders and rebels \u2014
    a direct reflection\nof the DIY spirit that defined West Berlin's underground
    scene."
  extraInfoImage: {fileID: 0}
